    "corrections": [
      "0464: carved first card and two blank reply cards remain distinct; carving hands meet pointed stone; tail ink reaches underwater card; half character disappears above waterline and returns only after rewriting; submerged flat stone supports the reading cards; snail remains on dry shore.",
      "0465: thick narrow boat sinks empty, low broad boat floods with passenger, high broad boat tests stone plus book before passenger; book removed from premature second trial; table boats and bowls rest on supports; snail waits on shore stone, hands meet clay, branch reaches stern, seated postures lowered; final passenger reads under fern with empty boat waiting."
    ],
    "limitations": "Original simplified geometric artwork. Complete contact sheets plus fourteen distinct closeups; not every page separately at original resolution, not human full audio listening."
